OL,3,AEd Sheeran admits 'mistakes' at first
OL,4,Ashow since Macklemore controversy
OL,5,
OL,6,FEd Sheeran has apologised to fans for
OL,7,Fmaking "mistakes" as he opened his
OL,8,Ffirst show since Macklemore was dropped
OL,9,Ffrom his tour for making
OL,10,Fpro-Palestinian remarks on stage.
OL,12,FThe singer began his concert in
OL,13,FPhiladelphia by addressing the
OL,14,Fcontroversy that has since engulfed the
OL,15,Ftour and prompted all of his support
OL,16,Facts to quit.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,171,160,200,105,0,100
